  "captions": [
    {
      "from": 12,
      "duration": 78,
      "text": "凌晨三点，线上告警又响了。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 96,
      "duration": 89,
      "text": "如果你还在顶着黑眼圈爬起来重启服务器，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 185,
      "duration": 113,
      "text": "说明该让 Kubernetes，也就是 K8s，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 298,
      "duration": 33,
      "text": "来替你值班了。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 340,
      "duration": 89,
      "text": "平时用 Docker 跑单个应用很方便，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 429,
      "duration": 31,
      "text": "打包就能运行。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 466,
      "duration": 143,
      "text": "但业务规模一上来，几十台服务器、上千个容器同时跑。",
      "highlight": "上千个容器"
    },
    {
      "from": 618,
      "duration": 61,
      "text": "容器崩溃了谁来拉起？",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 685,
      "duration": 53,
      "text": "流量暴涨怎么扩容？",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 744,
      "duration": 75,
      "text": "发新版本怎么做到不中断服务？",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 825,
      "duration": 98,
      "text": "全靠人工维护，小牛马迟早扛不住。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 955,
      "duration": 54,
      "text": "K8s 的核心思路，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 1009,
      "duration": 97,
      "text": "是把所有服务器整合成一个自动化集群。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 1112,
      "duration": 108,
      "text": "真正负责运行应用的每一台机器，叫做 Node，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 1220,
      "duration": 37,
      "text": "也就是工作节点。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 1266,
      "duration": 94,
      "text": "不过 K8s 并不直接调度单个容器，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 1360,
      "duration": 100,
      "text": "而是给容器套上一层外壳，叫做 Pod。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 1466,
      "duration": 92,
      "text": "它是 K8s 创建和调度的最小单元。",
      "highlight": "最小单元"
    },
    {
      "from": 1567,
      "duration": 126,
      "text": "同一个 Pod 里的容器，共享同一个网络 IP，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 1693,
      "duration": 79,
      "text": "可以通过本地回环地址直接通信，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 1772,
      "duration": 63,
      "text": "也能共享声明好的存储卷，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 1835,
      "duration": 95,
      "text": "比如主服务配一个采集日志的边车容器。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 1939,
      "duration": 113,
      "text": "如果开发、测试、生产都共用同一个集群，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 2052,
      "duration": 66,
      "text": "怎么避免重名和误操作？",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 2124,
      "duration": 132,
      "text": "K8s 提供了 Namespace，也就是命名空间，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 2256,
      "duration": 127,
      "text": "用来做资源分组、名称隔离，以及权限和资源配额管理。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 2392,
      "duration": 111,
      "text": "记住一个关键前提：Pod 天生是临时性的，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 2503,
      "duration": 138,
      "text": "随时可能被销毁和重建，不要把它当成永久不变的服务器。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 2673,
      "duration": 126,
      "text": "既然 Pod 随时会重建，怎么保证线上服务始终稳定？",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 2805,
      "duration": 63,
      "text": "这就靠 Deployment，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 2868,
      "duration": 71,
      "text": "以及 K8s 最核心的声明式管理。",
      "highlight": "声明式管理"
    },
    {
      "from": 2948,
      "duration": 80,
      "text": "你不需要写脚本一步步教它怎么修，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 3028,
      "duration": 90,
      "text": "只需要在 YAML 里声明目标状态：",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 3118,
      "duration": 106,
      "text": "我要三个 v1 版本的 Pod 持续在线。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 3230,
      "duration": 118,
      "text": "Deployment 会通过底层的 ReplicaSet 盯着副本数。",
      "highlight": "ReplicaSet"
    },
    {
      "from": 3357,
      "duration": 85,
      "text": "一旦某个 Pod 崩溃或被误删，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 3442,
      "duration": 137,
      "text": "控制器几秒内就会拉起一个新的补齐；哪怕整台节点失联，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 3579,
      "duration": 122,
      "text": "也会把受影响的 Pod 重新调度到健康节点上，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 3701,
      "duration": 42,
      "text": "这就是自愈能力。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 3752,
      "duration": 57,
      "text": "升级到 v2 版本时，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 3809,
      "duration": 104,
      "text": "Deployment 默认采用滚动更新：",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 3913,
      "duration": 47,
      "text": "先启动新 Pod，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 3960,
      "duration": 99,
      "text": "等就绪探针检查通过、确认能接流量之后，",
      "highlight": "就绪探针"
    },
    {
      "from": 4059,
      "duration": 89,
      "text": "再下线旧 Pod，全程业务不中断，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 4148,
      "duration": 53,
      "text": "出问题还能一键回滚。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 4210,
      "duration": 76,
      "text": "如果大促期间流量暴涨怎么办？",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 4292,
      "duration": 87,
      "text": "可以配上 HPA，水平自动扩缩容。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 4385,
      "duration": 101,
      "text": "它根据 CPU、内存或自定义指标，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 4486,
      "duration": 136,
      "text": "自动调高副本数扛住高峰；流量回落后再平稳缩容，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 4622,
      "duration": 41,
      "text": "既稳又省成本。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 4695,
      "duration": 115,
      "text": "紧接着就会遇到一个现实问题：Pod 每次重建，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 4810,
      "duration": 124,
      "text": "分配到的 IP 都会变，其他服务该怎么稳定找到它？",
      "highlight": "IP 都会变"
    },
    {
      "from": 4943,
      "duration": 42,
      "text": "答案是 Service。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 4991,
      "duration": 158,
      "text": "它相当于给这组 Pod 提供固定的虚拟 IP 和集群内域名，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 5149,
      "duration": 100,
      "text": "通过标签选择器持续追踪健康的 Pod，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 5249,
      "duration": 79,
      "text": "并把请求自动负载均衡转发过去。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 5337,
      "duration": 100,
      "text": "那集群外部的用户通过浏览器访问怎么办？",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 5443,
      "duration": 76,
      "text": "可以在入口配置 Ingress，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 5519,
      "duration": 71,
      "text": "配合 Ingress 控制器，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 5590,
      "duration": 119,
      "text": "统一管理域名、HTTPS 证书，并按路径精准路由：",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 5709,
      "duration": 115,
      "text": "比如 api 路径转后端，shop 路径转商城。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 5856,
      "duration": 54,
      "text": "再来解决两个工程痛点。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 5916,
      "duration": 92,
      "text": "第一，开发和生产环境的配置不同，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 6008,
      "duration": 93,
      "text": "不能每改一行配置就重新打包镜像。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 6107,
      "duration": 89,
      "text": "K8s 用 ConfigMap 管普通配置，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 6196,
      "duration": 105,
      "text": "用 Secret 管密码和密钥，动态挂载进 Pod。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 6310,
      "duration": 47,
      "text": "这里顺带提醒一句，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 6357,
      "duration": 115,
      "text": "Secret 默认只是 Base64 编码，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 6472,
      "duration": 42,
      "text": "并不是自动加密，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 6514,
      "duration": 152,
      "text": "在生产环境里还需要开启 etcd 静态加密并配好访问权限。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 6675,
      "duration": 137,
      "text": "第二，Pod 是临时性的，重启后本地数据就会丢失。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 6818,
      "duration": 65,
      "text": "所以持久化数据要解耦出来：",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 6883,
      "duration": 70,
      "text": "PV 代表底层持久化存储卷，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 6953,
      "duration": 94,
      "text": "PVC 是 Pod 提交的存储申请单，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 7047,
      "duration": 119,
      "text": "也可以通过 StorageClass 动态创建。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 7175,
      "duration": 77,
      "text": "以后哪怕 Pod 换了好几茬，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 7252,
      "duration": 61,
      "text": "重新绑定同一个 PVC，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 7313,
      "duration": 82,
      "text": "里面的数据库和文件依然完整保留。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 7427,
      "duration": 73,
      "text": "最后，我们掀开 K8s 的引擎盖，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 7500,
      "duration": 90,
      "text": "看看它的大脑 Control Plane，",
      "highlight": "Control Plane"
    },
    {
      "from": 7590,
      "duration": 47,
      "text": "到底是怎么协调全场的。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 7646,
      "duration": 77,
      "text": "当你敲下 kubectl apply，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 7723,
      "duration": 113,
      "text": "提交一份要三个 Pod 的 Deployment 清单，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 7836,
      "duration": 76,
      "text": "所有组件都会围绕一个核心枢纽协同工作。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 7921,
      "duration": 88,
      "text": "第一步，请求先发到 API Server。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 8015,
      "duration": 131,
      "text": "它是整个集群唯一的统一入口，负责鉴权、校验，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 8146,
      "duration": 137,
      "text": "并把你的期望状态写入集群键值数据库 etcd。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 8289,
      "duration": 15,
      "text": "记住，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 8304,
      "duration": 123,
      "text": "只有 API Server 会直接读写 etcd。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 8436,
      "duration": 12,
      "text": "第二步，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 8448,
      "duration": 130,
      "text": "Controller Manager 通过 Watch 机制监听 API Server。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 8584,
      "duration": 78,
      "text": "发现你新建了 Deployment，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 8662,
      "duration": 69,
      "text": "就先创建 ReplicaSet，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 8731,
      "duration": 74,
      "text": "再比对期望副本数三和当前零的差距，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 8805,
      "duration": 121,
      "text": "向 API Server 请求创建三个待调度的 Pod。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 8932,
      "duration": 57,
      "text": "这就是著名的调谐循环。",
      "highlight": "调谐循环"
    },
    {
      "from": 8998,
      "duration": 18,
      "text": "第三步，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 9016,
      "duration": 119,
      "text": "Scheduler 同样监听 API Server，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 9135,
      "duration": 64,
      "text": "看到还没分配节点的 Pod，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 9199,
      "duration": 123,
      "text": "就会综合各节点的 CPU、内存和调度策略选出最佳落点，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 9322,
      "duration": 91,
      "text": "再把绑定结果写回 API Server。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 9422,
      "duration": 19,
      "text": "第四步，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 9441,
      "duration": 124,
      "text": "目标节点上的 kubelet 监听到派给自己的任务，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 9565,
      "duration": 57,
      "text": "调用容器运行时拉起容器，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 9622,
      "duration": 100,
      "text": "再把最新状态回报给 API Server；",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 9722,
      "duration": 128,
      "text": "同时每个节点上的 kube-proxy 监听服务变化，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 9850,
      "duration": 85,
      "text": "更新网络转发规则，整套闭环就跑通了。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 9967,
      "duration": 119,
      "text": "现在把今天所有的拼图合起来看，K8s 其实非常清晰：",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 10086,
      "duration": 142,
      "text": "上方控制平面围绕 API Server 负责记账、调谐和调度，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 10228,
      "duration": 156,
      "text": "下方工作节点由 kubelet 和 kube-proxy 落地执行；",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 10384,
      "duration": 211,
      "text": "再配合命名空间、Deployment、HPA、Service、Ingress、配置和存储卷，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 10595,
      "duration": 43,
      "text": "整套体系就齐活了。",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 10647,
      "duration": 101,
      "text": "学习 K8s 不要一上来就死背命令，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 10748,
      "duration": 123,
      "text": "先记住它的底层灵魂：你只管声明你想要的世界，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 10871,
      "duration": 100,
      "text": "K8s 永远在帮你把现实追平到理想。",
      "highlight": "把现实追平到理想"
    },
    {
      "from": 10980,
      "duration": 88,
      "text": "如果这期帮到你了，记得点赞收藏，",
      "highlight": ""
    },
    {
      "from": 11068,
      "duration": 133,
      "text": "早日把运维脏活交给 K8s，小牛马准点打卡下班！",
      "highlight": ""
    }
  ]
}
